## Citation

If you use Yambo in your research, please cite:

> Yambo: An ab initio tool for excited state calculations of solids and nanostructures  
> A. Marini, C. Hogan, M. Grüning, D. Varsano  
> Computer Physics Communications, 180, 1392 (2009)

